      "content": "the prescription stuff is just some oxycodone and some muscle relaxants. would it be okay to take one of those along with the tylenol and ibuprofen? i'm really struggling to get comfortable and the pain is making me feel a bit lightheaded. it's definitely a lot more than just a dull ache. if i mix them it should work better right?",
